# Local git worktrees. These are checkouts, never repo content — and without
# this they are also uploaded by `vercel deploy`, which reads .gitignore and
# has no .vercelignore here. That was 383MB of other sessions' working copies
# heading into a deployment that would then serve them for as long as the
# deployment URL exists.
worktrees/
